{"version":1,"content":"<p>呂慧儀自2019年宣布離婚並成為單親媽媽後，母兼父職，在繁忙的演藝工作與照顧家庭之餘，創辦並經營自己的教育中心。</p><p>她更利用工餘時間半工讀，成功於網上修畢英國牛津大學賽德商學院（Saïd Business School, University of Oxford）的行政領導課程（Executive Leadership Programme），各科成績均達80分以上順利取得證書。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:00:17.454200+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:18:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:17:35.122511+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:57:39.230287+00:00","content_hash":"386fb247716d2a8b9ef455892f0602689132ce20140615a6561f1ff484b081ef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}